  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Low Profile Plate Carrier Vest is specially crafted to optimize your tactical loadout with a minimalist design that supports quick movements in the field. The front and back of the plate carrier vest each feature 7 rows of MOLLE webbing for mounting holsters, mag pouches, and more. The top three rows of MOLLE webbing on the front and back of the lightweight plate carrier feature loop material for adding flags and morale patches. The hook and loop adjustable shoulder straps on the MOLLE vest are enclosed within an additional hook and loop closure for finsding and maintaining the perfect fit (shoulder straps measure 2.13 inches wide). The adjustable plate carrier cummerbund secures via buckle closures and features a hook and loop closure at the end of each web strap for organizing excess webbing. The front and back panels are built with breathable and comfortable mesh ventilation for optimal cooling airflow. The minimalist plate carrier features two hook and loop closures over each shoulder strap for hydration hose integration. This army plate carrier vest is perfect for soldiers, public safety, and MilSim players. The vest fits medium or large SAPI/ESAPI plates up to 10 inches x 13 inches.&nbsp;</p>",
